<title>QATAR: SOCCER-QATAR BEAT INDIA 6-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-QATAR BEAT INDIA 6-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qatar beat India 6-0 (halftime 3-0)</p>
<p>in an Asian Group 10 World Cup soccer qualifier on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers - Mohammad Salem al-Enazi(26th, 39th minutes), Zamal</p>
<p>Issa (41st), Waleed Bakhit (46th), Mohammad Soufi (50th),</p>
<p>Mubarak Mustafa (61st).</p>
<p>Attendance - 2,500</p>
